\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Proportion of models improving over the non-diffusion baseline (b0), stratified by task and feature. Improvement is based on fold-level normalized differences ($\Delta $ = feature $-$ b0). Left: statistical criterion (t-test against zero, p < 0.05 and mean $\Delta $ > 0); Right: robustness criterion (median $\Delta \geq $ 0.03 and $\geq $80\% positive folds). Cells report the fraction of models meeting each criterion per target (rows) and feature (columns).}}{8}{}\protected@file@percent }
